LICENSE

1. VoodooGPIO
This repository contains prebuilt binary (kext) compiled from VoodooGPIO.
VoodooGPIO is licensed under GNU General Public License Version 3 (GPLv3).

Original source repository: https://github.com/bafcz/VoodooGPIO
GPLv3 license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

The corresponding source code for this binary is available at the above original repository.
No modifications have been made to VoodooGPIO source code for this build.

2. VoodooI2C
The C/C++ source code of VoodooI2C remains unchanged.
Only the attached Info.plist configuration file has been modified, referencing the implementation idea from bafcz's VoodooGPIO.
Added IOPCIMatch entry `0x7a7c8086&0xFFFCFFFF` to enable recognition of the target I2C controller.
VoodooI2C is licensed under GPLv3.
This modified Info.plist is included within this EFI package.

3. MacKernelSDK
This project is built using MacKernelSDK (https://github.com/acidanthera/MacKernelSDK).
MacKernelSDK contains header files derived from Apple Darwin open source code, licensed under Apple Public Source License Version 2.0 (APSL 2.0).

Original Apple open source: https://opensource.apple.com/
APSL 2.0 license text: https://opensource.apple.com/apsl/

No modifications were made to files within MacKernelSDK for this build.

4. WTLWireless
WiFi & Bluetooth driver from watchthelight-labs/WTLWireless.
Original source repository: https://github.com/watchthelight-labs/WTLWireless

Main code is licensed under ISC licence, except individual files specifying other licences:
- Some Wi‑Fi core / menu components: Clear BSD‑3‑Clause (itlmt7925)
- Some Bluetooth code: Clear BSD‑3‑Clause (MtkBtFw)
- MediaTek firmware in firmware/: MediaTek redistributable licence
See the project's NOTICE.md and licence files for full details.

5. Other bundled kexts
All remaining kexts included in this EFI are obtained unchanged from their official Release builds,
without any modification to binaries, Info.plist or other internal files.
Each of these kexts is governed by its own original license from the respective author.
Please refer to their official project repositories for complete copyright and license information.
